## 4. Selection versus holdout

Selection seeds 100–119 were used for every choice; holdout seeds 1000–1019 were run once. Central variant, KPIs over weeks 104–155, annualised.

{{RESULT:val.consistency_table}}

Reading: the legacy baseline replicated closely. The recommended plan I125 was optimistic on selection: {{RESULT:frontier.recommended.selection_aog_hours}} on selection against {{RESULT:frontier.recommended.aog_hours}} {{RESULT:frontier.recommended.aog_hours_ci}} on holdout ({{RESULT:frontier.recommended.selection_shift_pct}}), while P2 moved {{RESULT:policies.P2.selection_shift_pct}}. The paired improvement of I125 over P2 replicated: {{RESULT:frontier.recommended_vs_P2.selection_delta}} on selection, {{RESULT:frontier.recommended_vs_P2.delta_aog_hours}} {{RESULT:frontier.recommended_vs_P2.delta_aog_hours_ci}} on holdout.

